docs/literature/raw/exec22_riv_aer_0.txt:63: trailing whitespace.
+    \item{offset}{either the offset used (if any) or \code{NULL} (if none).}
docs/literature/raw/exec22_riv_aer_0.txt:64: trailing whitespace.
+    \item{n}{number of observations.}
docs/literature/raw/exec22_riv_aer_0.txt:65: trailing whitespace.
+    \item{nobs}{number of observations with non-zero weights.}
docs/literature/raw/exec22_riv_aer_0.txt:66: trailing whitespace.
+    \item{rank}{the numeric rank of the fitted linear model.}
docs/literature/raw/exec22_riv_aer_0.txt:67: trailing whitespace.
