docs/literature/raw/exec22_riv_aer_0.txt:68: trailing whitespace.
+    \item{cov.unscaled}{unscaled covariance matrix for the coefficients.}
docs/literature/raw/exec22_riv_aer_0.txt:69: trailing whitespace.
+    \item{sigma}{residual standard error.}
docs/literature/raw/exec22_riv_aer_0.txt:70: trailing whitespace.
